      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "entity:source-meet_peri.step.1.desc",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "prov:value": "Peri sets the scene and asks your child what they notice. No right answer yet — just looking."
    },
    {
      "@id": "entity:target-meet_peri.step.1.desc-v1",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "prov:value": "Pery sahney yerleşir ve çocuğun dikkat ettiğini sorar. Henüz doğru cevap yok - sadece bakıyorlar.",
      "generated_by": {
        "@id": "activity:translation-meet_peri.step.1.desc-2026-07-09T07:42:27.383780+00:00"
      },
      "used_source": {
        "@id": "entity:source-meet_peri.step.1.desc"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "activity:translation-meet_peri.step.2.desc-2026-07-09T07:42:27.383780+00:00",
      "@type": "prov:Activity",
      "prov:startTime": "2026-07-09T07:42:27.383780+00:00",
      "actor": {
        "@id": "agent:OLLAMA-mistral-nemo_12b_Profile__General_Balanced_Content_|_Temp__0.3"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "entity:source-meet_peri.step.2.desc",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "prov:value": "Your child records what they see, hear, or measure. Peri prompts for specifics if the answer is vague."
    },
    {
      "@id": "entity:target-meet_peri.step.2.desc-v1",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "prov:value": "Çocuğun gözlemlediği veya ölçüdüğü şeyleri kaydeder. Peri belirsizlik durumunda detay istemektedir.",
      "generated_by": {
        "@id": "activity:translation-meet_peri.step.2.desc-2026-07-09T07:42:27.383780+00:00"
      },
      "used_source": {
        "@id": "entity:source-meet_peri.step.2.desc"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "activity:translation-meet_peri.step.3.desc-2026-07-09T07:42:50.122115+00:00",
      "@type": "prov:Activity",
      "prov:startTime": "2026-07-09T07:42:50.122115+00:00",
      "actor": {
        "@id": "agent:OLLAMA-mistral-nemo_12b_Profile__General_Balanced_Content_|_Temp__0.3"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "entity:source-meet_peri.step.3.desc",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "prov:value": "Peri asks comparison and classification questions. What\\'s similar? What\\'s different? What pattern do you see?"
    },
    {
      "@id": "entity:target-meet_peri.step.3.desc-v1",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "prov:value": "Piri benzerlikleri ve farklılıkları sorar. Hangileri benzer? Hangileri farklı? Hangisi bir desen görüyorsunuz?",
      "generated_by": {
        "@id": "activity:translation-meet_peri.step.3.desc-2026-07-09T07:42:50.122115+00:00"
      },
      "used_source": {
        "@id": "entity:source-meet_peri.step.3.desc"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "activity:translation-meet_peri.step.4.desc-2026-07-09T07:42:50.122115+00:00",
      "@type": "prov:Activity",
      "prov:startTime": "2026-07-09T07:42:50.122115+00:00",
      "actor": {
        "@id": "agent:OLLAMA-mistral-nemo_12b_Profile__General_Balanced_Content_|_Temp__0.3"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "entity:source-meet_peri.step.4.desc",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "prov:value": "Your child proposes a cause or mechanism. Peri tests it with evidence questions, not hints."
    },
    {
      "@id": "entity:target-meet_peri.step.4.desc-v1",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "prov:value": "Çocuğunuz bir neden veya mekanizma öneriyor. Peri bu iddiayı kanıt sorularıyla, ipuçlarıyla değil, deniyor.",
      "generated_by": {
        "@id": "activity:translation-meet_peri.step.4.desc-2026-07-09T07:42:50.122115+00:00"
      },
      "used_source": {
        "@id": "entity:source-meet_peri.step.4.desc"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "activity:translation-meet_peri.step.5.desc-2026-07-09T07:42:50.122115+00:00",
      "@type": "prov:Activity",
      "prov:startTime": "2026-07-09T07:42:50.122115+00:00",
      "actor": {
        "@id": "agent:OLLAMA-mistral-nemo_12b_Profile__General_Balanced_Content_|_Temp__0.3"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "entity:source-meet_peri.step.5.desc",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "prov:value": "Peri asks what this means for a new situation. Knowledge becomes portable."
    },
    {
      "@id": "entity:target-meet_peri.step.5.desc-v1",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "prov:value": "Piri yeni bir durum için bu ne anlama geliyor diye soruyor. Bilgi taşınabilir hale geliyor.",
      "generated_by": {
        "@id": "activity:translation-meet_peri.step.5.desc-2026-07-09T07:42:50.122115+00:00"
      },
      "used_source": {
        "@id": "entity:source-meet_peri.step.5.desc"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "activity:translation-meet_peri.exchange.1.text-2026-07-09T07:42:50.122115+00:00",
      "@type": "prov:Activity",
      "prov:startTime": "2026-07-09T07:42:50.122115+00:00",
      "actor": {
        "@id": "agent:OLLAMA-mistral-nemo_12b_Profile__General_Balanced_Content_|_Temp__0.3"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "entity:source-meet_peri.exchange.1.text",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "prov:value": "You\\'re at the creek bank. Before we measure anything — what\\'s the first thing you notice about the water right here versus ten feet upstream?"
    },
    {
      "@id": "entity:target-meet_peri.exchange.1.text-v1",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "prov:value": "Su Creek'in kenarında bulundusunuz. Herhangi bir şey ölçmeden önce – burada bulunduğunuz yere göre on metre akışın yukarısındaki suyun ne olduğunu ilk olarak dikkatlerinize çeken şey nedir?",
      "generated_by": {
        "@id": "activity:translation-meet_peri.exchange.1.text-2026-07-09T07:42:50.122115+00:00"
      },
      "used_source": {
        "@id": "entity:source-meet_peri.exchange.1.text"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "activity:translation-meet_peri.exchange.2.text-2026-07-09T07:42:50.122115+00:00",
      "@type": "prov:Activity",
      "prov:startTime": "2026-07-09T07:42:50.122115+00:00",
      "actor": {
        "@id": "agent:OLLAMA-mistral-nemo_12b_Profile__General_Balanced_Content_|_Temp__0.3"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "entity:source-meet_peri.exchange.2.text",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "prov:value": "It\\'s slower here and there\\'s more mud on the bottom."
    },
    {
      "@id": "entity:target-meet_peri.exchange.2.text-v1",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "prov:value": "Daha yavaş burada ve daha fazla çamur dibinde.",
      "generated_by": {
        "@id": "activity:translation-meet_peri.exchange.2.text-2026-07-09T07:42:50.122115+00:00"
      },
      "used_source": {
        "@id": "entity:source-meet_peri.exchange.2.text"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "activity:translation-meet_peri.exchange.3.text-2026-07-09T07:43:12.254827+00:00",
      "@type": "prov:Activity",
      "prov:startTime": "2026-07-09T07:43:12.254827+00:00",
      "actor": {
        "@id": "agent:OLLAMA-mistral-nemo_12b_Profile__General_Balanced_Content_|_Temp__0.3"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "entity:source-meet_peri.exchange.3.text",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "prov:value": "Good observation. Why do you think the mud settled here and not upstream where the water is faster?"
    },
    {
      "@id": "entity:target-meet_peri.exchange.3.text-v1",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "prov:value": "İyi gözlem. Bu çamurın buraya değil akışın daha hızlı olduğu yukarıda çakılma nedenini neyin düşündüğünüz?",
      "generated_by": {
        "@id": "activity:translation-meet_peri.exchange.3.text-2026-07-09T07:43:12.254827+00:00"
      },
      "used_source": {
        "@id": "entity:source-meet_peri.exchange.3.text"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "activity:translation-meet_peri.exchange.4.text-2026-07-09T07:43:12.254827+00:00",
      "@type": "prov:Activity",
      "prov:startTime": "2026-07-09T07:43:12.254827+00:00",
      "actor": {
        "@id": "agent:OLLAMA-mistral-nemo_12b_Profile__General_Balanced_Content_|_Temp__0.3"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "entity:source-meet_peri.exchange.4.text",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "prov:value": "Maybe slower water can\\'t carry as much stuff?"
    },
    {
      "@id": "entity:target-meet_peri.exchange.4.text-v1",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "prov:value": "Su içecek daha yavaş akarken o kadar çok şey taşımayabilir mi?",
      "generated_by": {
        "@id": "activity:translation-meet_peri.exchange.4.text-2026-07-09T07:43:12.254827+00:00"
      },
      "used_source": {
        "@id": "entity:source-meet_peri.exchange.4.text"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "activity:translation-meet_peri.exchange.5.text-2026-07-09T07:43:12.254827+00:00",
      "@type": "prov:Activity",
      "prov:startTime": "2026-07-09T07:43:12.254827+00:00",
      "actor": {
        "@id": "agent:OLLAMA-mistral-nemo_12b_Profile__General_Balanced_Content_|_Temp__0.3"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "entity:source-meet_peri.exchange.5.text",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "prov:value": "That\\'s the right direction. What could you measure or photograph here to support that idea?"
    },
    {
      "@id": "entity:target-meet_peri.exchange.5.text-v1",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "prov:value": "O'nun doğru yön olduğu. Burada ne ölçebilir veya fotoğrafçayabilirsin bu fikri desteklemek için?",
      "generated_by": {
        "@id": "activity:translation-meet_peri.exchange.5.text-2026-07-09T07:43:12.254827+00:00"
      },
      "used_source": {
        "@id": "entity:source-meet_peri.exchange.5.text"
      }
    },
